Club Clubhouse, complete with elevated food offerings, full open bar service, and both indoor and outdoor spaces overlooking the final hole.<\/p> \n\n<p>The experience continues on the course with entry to VIP Viewing Decks on Holes 9 and 2, offering impressive sightlines of Holes 2, 5, 6 tee, and 9 green, plus beverages served throughout the day. It\u2019s the ultimate way to take in the final day of competition.<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>HOW TO ENTER:\u202fNO PURCHASE NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>To enter, complete the entry form below. The Sweepstakes entry period begins at 9:00 a.m. Pacific Time (\u201cPT\u201d) on November 17, 2025, and ends at 11:59 p.m. PT on November 24, 2025.<\/p>\n\n<p>The winner will receive two (2) Captains Club Tickets for Sunday\u202fat the SKECHERS World Champions Cup Supporting Shriners Children\u2019s golf tournament taking place December 7, 2025 at Feather Sound Country Club in Clearwater, Florida. See Official Rules below for details.<\/p>"}},{"type":"button","uid":"xw6siyr","size":"1\/1","tablet_size":"1\/1","mobile_size":"1\/1","used_fonts":"","attr":{"title":"Official Giveaway Rules","link":"https:\/\/worldchampionscup.com\/ticket-giveaway\/","target":"1","icon_position":"left","size":"2","button_function_copy_to_clipboard_tooltip":"Copy to clipboard","button_function_copy_to_clipboard_copied_tooltip":"Copied","css__text_align":{"selector":".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement","style":"text-align","val":{"desktop":"center"}},"css_button_border_style":{"selector":".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button","style":"border-style","val":"solid"},"css_button_border_width":{"selector":".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button","style":"border-width","val":{"desktop":"2px 2px 2px 2px"}},"css_button_box_shadow":{"selector":".mcb-section .mcb-wrap .mcb-item-mfnuidelement .button","style":"box-shadow","val":{"desktop":" 0px 0px 0px 0px #000000"}},"css_button_color":{"selector":".mcb-secti